(Root-cause note:) Tj
0 -12 Td
(The app was bound to 127.0.0.1 inside the container.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(That left the Node process alive \(so Docker would show Up\), but Docker's published-port traffic could not reach it.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Binding to 0.0.0.0:8080 makes the service reachable through the published port.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Docker is unavailable in this execution environment, so pages 1–2 document that limitation; page 6 is a direct runtime validation.) Tj
ET
